{"speciesId":775,"names":{"fr":"Dodoala","es":"Komala","en":"Komala","ja":"ネッコアラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il rejoint et quitte ce monde en dormant. Son existence se déroule comme un rêve paisible. Il dort du sommeil du juste toute sa vie durant."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Pasa la vida entera sumido en un profundo sueño. Toda su actividad parece reflejar los sueños que tiene en ese momento."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It is born asleep, and it dies asleep. All its movements are apparently no more than the results of it tossing and turning in its dreams."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"寝たまま 生まれ 寝たまま 死ぬ。 すべての 行動は みている 夢に よる 寝相 らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"La bûche qu’il tient est un cadeau de naissance de ses parents. S’il est bien apprivoisé, il s’accrochera au bras de son Dresseur."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"El tronco que agarra es un regalo que le dieron sus padres al nacer. También se aferra al brazo de todo aquel Entrenador con el que congenie."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"The log it holds was given to it by its parents at birth. It has also been known to cling to the arm of a friendly Trainer."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"抱いた 木は 生まれたとき 親から 与えられたもの。 よく なつけば トレーナーの 腕にも しがみつく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il dort continuellement depuis sa naissance. Lorsqu’il est en phase de sommeil profond, il ne bouge plus d’un poil."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Duerme continuamente desde que nace. Cuando el sueño en el que está sumido es especialmente profundo, se queda inmóvil."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It stays asleep from the moment it’s born. When it falls into a deep sleep, it stops moving altogether."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"生まれてから ずっと 眠ったまま。 深い 眠りに 落ちているときは 一切 動かなくなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ce Pokémon passe sa vie entière à dormir à cause des composants anesthésiants qui se trouvent dans les feuilles qu’il mange."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"El motivo de su letargo vitalicio es la sustancia somnífera que contienen las hojas de las que se alimenta."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It remains asleep from birth to death as a result of the sedative properties of the leaves that form its diet."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"死ぬまで ずっと 眠ったままなのは エサの 葉っぱに 麻酔の ような 成分が 含まれているからだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":775,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[17,"level-up",21],[18,"level-up",21],[25,"level-up",21]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[17,"level-up",46],[18,"level-up",46],[25,"level-up",46]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sing","learns":[[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"low-kick","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"defense-curl","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"rock-slide","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"super-fang","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thief","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"snore","learns":[[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"curse","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"flail","learns":[[17,"level-up",26],[18,"level-up",26],[25,"level-up",26]]},{"name":"reversal","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"protect","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"endur